    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6773cecbd84727fb47a2b566",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是，今年最『有趣』的事情了呢。\r\n以这“脉冲”……震撼全银河——",
      "source_fingerprint": "56795c307afcdfe558917e2c509853807b86dd6096f470458763da31cb40b360",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
