    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d096cc9c6e78b3ddec46b0fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要为今年带来一个完美的落幕呢……！\r\n说起来……那位选手，今天也是热情洋溢呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae45b6ba1e3aa449b2be4c7156ba06901238f45854a2e4a9dcfdd7cc05358301",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
