      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈！起舞吧，起舞吧！\r\n既然彼此的波长都已经一致——\r\n那今天，称得上是“狂欢节”了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9a36c5cacac83014a6121cddf5e2a10bded6faccc52acf3cda5f5fe83e652b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
