    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34efa5dfdc578d3ecc86a530",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "集训结束之后，\r\n『菊花赏』终于要到来了。\r\n为了激励新宇宙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c179858e5e8d2cc104512b3015e33b3b6c764e57d0bfbb2d6964d312171f38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105300.json",
