      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加者除我和新宇宙外，\r\n还有小栗帽与那位训练员。\r\n虽然确实是非常奇妙的组合……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fccf5a590ade8c027ac062e7a4d2ded0b68ed909d6e1f9087c9702e5a539bae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
